    "description": "Decatur Industries\nWalnut Pipe Stand Carousel with Green Glass Humidor & 8 Estate Pipes\nWalnut Wood, Textured Glass, Mixed Materials\nVintage smoking pipe carousel stand manufactured by Decatur Industries, featuring an 8-slot solid walnut rack paired with a textured green glass tobacco humidor jar and a wooden lid topped with an Oscar the Grouch figural finial. The lot includes eight collectible estate smoking pipes representing classic briar, metal frame, and mid-century synthetic styles.\nDecatur Industries rotating walnut carousel with 8 pipe storage slots\nCenter textured green glass humidor jar with embossed maker mark on base and Oscar the Grouch lid handle\nLot of 8 vintage pipes including \"The Smoke\" marbled graphite pipe, a blue pipe, a gold-tone radiator pipe, and 5 carved briar pipes\nMeasures approximately 9.75 by 9.75 inches and 8.5 inches high\nCondition:\nWood carousel and green glass jar are well preserved with light surface wear and no chips or cracks. Pipes are in pre-owned estate condition displaying smoke charring, bowl cake, and light stem tooth marks consistent with age and use.",
